Z||000000||KRMFiero||07-04-2001||01:28 AM||||Has anyone ever notice that there are a few people on this forum that when you seem to say one thing to them that they dont want to hear they try to like piss everyone off as much as possible, I dont get it... Then usally they want us to forgive them the next day, I dont get it at all...  <P>I just finished reading up on this Ed thing and stuff, It makes me thing that how much Cliff does give to us, Thank you Cliff! <P>I am so tired I have been working on my Fiero all day removing body panels and stuff so I can paint it, I was pulling the black trim around the windshild up so I can take of the roof, I noticed how sticky the black stuff was and that it was holding the windshield in so i came up with the bright idea of lets pry the windshield a little bit to see if it will come off (dont know why I did I just did and I regret it) now I have a nice long Crack in my winshield that had no cracks/pebble marks or anything, So not happy...<P>Oh yeah, Cliff may not want any money from us but I think he deserves something, I seriously think we all should just donate atleast $1.00 a month to him, that doesnt seem like alot but if everyone (active members) on the forum does He will get around $1000 at least a month and he well deserves it, I know i can afford to give him $1 a month, Anyone think this is a Good Idea, I love this Forum<P>Kyle||||reg||1
